  -  [NOT]Have participated in any systematic exercise program for at least six months prior to the start of this project.
  -  To have a body mass index (BMI) between 22 [AND] 30 kg / m2.
  -  [NOT]Are cardiopathic, diabetic [OR] have any other metabolic disease.
  -  [NOT]Present joint problems [OR] any other injury that [NOT]prevents the proper execution of the exercises of the training routine.
  -  [NOT]Smoker [OR] have quit smoking for at least five years ago.
  -  Release of the doctor (medical certificate) to perform the physical exercises.
Exclusion Criteria:
  -  [NOT]Participate in at least 20 training sessions [OR] miss more than three consecutive training sessions.
