  2. [NOT]Any prior cancer diagnosis, [OR] with [OR] any treatment (e.g., medical, surgical, [OR] radiation oncology) within prior six months.
  3. [NOT]Any surgery, i.e., invasive procedure performed in the operating room with any level of anesthesia, within prior month.
  4. [NOT]Any non-cancer systemic therapy associated with molecularly targeted immune modulation, e.g., monoclonal antibodies.
  5. [NOT]Any concurrent [OR] prior pregnancy within previous twelve months.
  6. [NOT]Any history of organ tissue transplantation
  7. [NOT]Any history of blood product transfusion within prior month.
  8. [NOT]Any major trauma within prior six months, e.g., burn injury, extremity crush injury, motor vehicle accident, etc.
  9. [NOT]Able to provide informed consent.
